creatures:
- name: Young White Dragon
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 17  
      **Hit Points** 123 (rollable(dice=13d10 + 52,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 40 ft., Burrow 20 ft., Fly 80 ft., Swim 40 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Initiative) (13)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** cold  
      **Senses** blindsight 30 ft., darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 16  
      **Languages** Common, Draconic  
      **Challenge** 6 (2,300 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Traits

      ***Ice Walk.*** The dragon can move across and climb icy surfaces without needing to make an ability check. Additionally, ***Difficult Terrain*** composed of ice or snow doesn't cost it extra movement.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The dragon makes three Rend attacks.

      ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d4+4,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=1d4,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Cold damage.

      ***Cold Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Cold Breath])).*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 15, each creature in a 30-foot ***Cone***. *Failure:* rollable(dice=9d8,dicelabel=Damage [Cold Breath]) Cold damage. *Success:* Half damage.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Large Dragon (Chromatic), Chaotic Evil*  
    **Challenge** 6
